Description:It is your first main phase. You control a face-down Gathan Raiders (a 2/2; morph - discard a card; hellbent - it gets +2/+2 while you have no cards in hand) and have Colossal Dreadmaw in hand. You have no mana. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-morph-discard-cost | Turning a face-down permanent face up is a special action you may take whenever you have priority, by paying its morph cost (CR 702.37e, 116.2b), and that cost may be a non-mana cost: discard the Dreadmaw to turn Gathan Raiders face up, and with an empty hand it is a 5/5 that attacks for 5; the face-down 2/2 deals only 2
